#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:8
msgid "About Us"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:387
msgid "Back to Login"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:391
msgid "About RePo-SUDOE-AI"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:392
msgid ""
"Advancing molecular docking research through innovation and collaboration"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:412
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:414
msgid ""
"RePo-SUDOE-AI is dedicated to democratizing access to cutting-edge "
"computational chemistry tools. We believe that advanced molecular docking "
"simulations should be accessible to researchers at all levels, from "
"undergraduate students to leading scientists in pharmaceutical companies."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:417
msgid ""
"Our platform combines state-of-the-art algorithms with an intuitive user "
"interface, making complex molecular interactions understandable and "
"actionable. We are committed to accelerating drug discovery research across "
"Europe and beyond."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:420
msgid ""
"Through continuous innovation and collaboration with leading research "
"institutions, we strive to provide the most advanced, reliable, and user-"
"friendly molecular docking platform available."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:435
msgid "Meet Our Team"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:436
msgid "Building the future of accessible molecular docking"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:446
msgid "Platform Developer & Researcher"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:448
msgid ""
"Iker is the lead developer of the RePo-SUDOE-AI platform, working on his "
"thesis to create an accessible and intuitive molecular docking tool. He "
"combines expertise in software engineering with a passion for computational "
"chemistry, building upon frameworks like webina to create innovative "
"solutions for drug discovery research."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:452
msgid "University of A Coruña"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:463
msgid "Thesis Director & Scientific Advisor"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:465
msgid ""
"Carlos provides scientific guidance and expertise in computational biology "
"and bioinformatics. As thesis director, he oversees the development of the "
"platform, ensuring it meets the highest standards of scientific rigor while "
"remaining accessible to researchers. His experience in machine learning and "
"data analysis shapes the strategic direction of the project."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:469
msgid "CITIC Research Center, University of A Coruña"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:482
msgid "Platform Foundation"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:484
msgid ""
"The RePo-SUDOE-AI platform is another step forward in advancing scientific "
"knowledge and promoting the use of new technologies for drug repurposing in "
"the SUDOE region. By applying available previous knowledge, we developed a "
"system that allows users to run molecular docking experiments simply by "
"using natural language, and to visualize therapeutic targets and their "
"interactions with drugs in a 3D format. This interactive and educational "
"approach is designed to motivate young students and researchers in STEAM "
"fields."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:487
msgid ""
"The platform has an easy-to-use interface that lets users perform molecular "
"docking experiments and view the results in interactive 3D directly from "
"their browser, making complex methods easier to use for both researchers and"
" students."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:490
msgid ""
"One of our main goals is to develop and share advanced technologies for drug"
" repurposing, making this innovation accessible to everyone. In addition, "
"the prototype aims to serve as a starting point for a new educational model "
"in the SUDOE region, helping less developed areas and addressing population "
"challenges."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:505
msgid "About the RePo-SUDOE Project"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:507
msgid ""
"Drug Repurposing for Effective and Accelerated Drug Development in the SUDOE"
" Space"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:514
msgid "The Challenge"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:517
msgid ""
"The pharmaceutical development process often faces high failure rates, "
"costs, and delays. This highlights the importance of drug repurposing, which"
" finds new therapeutic uses for existing market drugs, benefiting the "
"pharmaceutical industry, society, and patients alike."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:523
msgid "Our Goal"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:526
msgid ""
"The RePo-SUDOE project aims to develop and disseminate drug repurposing "
"technologies to enhance the competitiveness of the SUDOE region in this R&D "
"area, boosting the biopharmaceutical industry and attracting skilled human "
"resources."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:532
msgid "Key Objectives"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:536
msgid ""
"Advance scientific knowledge and disseminate drug repurposing technologies "
"among public and private agents, elevating SUDOE's R&D groups to European "
"excellence."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:539
msgid ""
"Foster multidisciplinary collaboration and identify innovative opportunities"
" in SUDOE through a transnational network, developing a database of "
"therapeutic targets and drugs, with a primary focus on cancer treatment."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:542
msgid ""
"Create a prototype 3D visualization room for biological systems, utilizing "
"VR and AR, aimed at young students and researchers in STEAM fields."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:549
msgid "Regional Impact"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:552
msgid ""
"RePo-SUDOE unites partners from different SUDOE regions and sectors within "
"the pharmaceutical development value chain. It provides easily accessible "
"scientific information and visualization technologies to strengthen drug "
"repurposing within the SUDOE space."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:555
msgid ""
"The project addresses demographic challenges of aging and depopulation, "
"enhancing regional R&D competitiveness and bridging territorial disparities."
" By aligning with regional RIS3 strategies, RePo-SUDOE fosters innovation "
"and sustainable employment growth, particularly in regions with "
"traditionally low R&D intensity."
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:561
msgid "Learn more about the INTERREG SUDOE initiative"
msgstr ""

#: .\accounts\templates\accounts\about.html:565
msgid "Visit Project Website"
msgstr ""

